# ─── Tessera build artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tessera.Host/wwwroot is populated at publish time by the multi-stage
# Dockerfile (Phase 6). Keeping it out of source control means a clean
# checkout has an empty wwwroot and `dotnet publish` produces an
# asset-less runtime; the FE bundle flows through Docker layer caches.
src/host/Tessera.Host/wwwroot/
src/host/Tessera.Host/wwwroot/**/*

